WEBVTT

00:00:07.910 --> 00:00:11.250
<i>Who would love me so much</i>

00:00:11.250 --> 00:00:13.540
<i>that he would cast aside his own precious life?</i>

00:00:15.210 --> 00:00:18.750
<i>If someone were to drown in the seas and die for my sake,</i>

00:00:19.590 --> 00:00:22.090
<i>then I would be released from stone</i>

00:00:22.550 --> 00:00:26.010
<i>and I would return to life... to life once more.</i>

00:00:28.310 --> 00:00:32.430
<i>But if I were to return to life one day–</i>

00:00:33.190 --> 00:00:36.560
<i>which would give me the most important thing–</i>

00:00:38.610 --> 00:00:42.070
<i>I would then cry, alone.</i>

00:00:42.900 --> 00:00:45.740
<i>I would cry, longing for my stone.</i>

00:00:46.910 --> 00:00:49.620
<i>Of what use would my blood be,</i>

00:00:49.620 --> 00:00:51.370
<i>even if it were to ripen like wine?</i>

00:00:53.460 --> 00:00:57.920
<i>For it would not be able to bring
back the one who loved me the most</i>

00:00:57.920 --> 00:01:01.800
<i>from the waters' depths...</i>

00:01:25.200 --> 00:01:28.490
I was serious... This time, I was really serious.

00:01:28.990 --> 00:01:32.290
How could Sayaka have pulled that on me all of a sudden?

00:01:32.290 --> 00:01:33.450
That was so cruel of her!

00:01:35.460 --> 00:01:39.170
Okay, okay. We got it; you don't have to cry.

00:01:39.170 --> 00:01:41.250
Come to think of it, it was doomed from the beginning.

00:01:41.250 --> 00:01:43.630
A student at Shoutoku Women's College
and a student at our Meihou Art College...

00:01:44.010 --> 00:01:45.260
It just wouldn't have worked out.

00:01:46.880 --> 00:01:49.510
"In the end, milk vetch should be left in the fields."

00:01:49.510 --> 00:01:51.680
You should've left it as an unrequited crush.

00:01:51.680 --> 00:01:53.260
Don't give me that!?

00:01:53.270 --> 00:01:56.480
You're the one who told me that
love can overcome GPAs, Senpai!

00:01:56.890 --> 00:01:58.690
Oh, did I?

00:01:59.020 --> 00:01:59.980
Yes, you did!

00:02:00.560 --> 00:02:03.070
You were there, so you heard him too, right, Eiri?

00:02:03.070 --> 00:02:03.780
Huh?

00:02:03.780 --> 00:02:06.150
Sorry, I wasn't listening.

00:02:06.150 --> 00:02:07.070
What's up?

00:02:07.820 --> 00:02:10.280
Dude, what's up with your attitude?

00:02:10.280 --> 00:02:13.030
Your best friend is all depressed about a breakup!

00:02:13.040 --> 00:02:17.210
I'm not asking you to find me
another girl, but at least show a little support!

00:02:17.540 --> 00:02:18.540
Sorry, my fault.

00:02:19.290 --> 00:02:22.290
What's up with that beatific
smile? You look like the Virgin Mary.

00:02:22.840 --> 00:02:26.880
Haven't you been kinda out of it for the past week?

00:02:26.880 --> 00:02:28.090
You think so?

00:02:28.800 --> 00:02:30.050
Kurahashi,

00:02:30.050 --> 00:02:32.050
you're in love, aren't you?

00:02:32.050 --> 00:02:33.600
Your first love even. Am I wrong?

00:02:34.350 --> 00:02:35.300
You're absolutely right.

00:02:35.390 --> 00:02:36.680
What?!

00:02:36.680 --> 00:02:37.890
Seriously?

00:02:37.890 --> 00:02:39.350
How long's it been since you started going out?

00:02:39.350 --> 00:02:41.310
It's been about seven days now.

00:02:41.310 --> 00:02:42.980
Dude, when did you...

00:02:42.980 --> 00:02:44.150
Who's the girl?

00:02:44.150 --> 00:02:45.400
Where'd you land her?

00:02:46.820 --> 00:02:48.490
Sorry, I lied.

00:02:59.350 --> 00:03:01.220
I think I'll get going.

00:03:01.580 --> 00:03:02.540
Eiri...

00:03:02.540 --> 00:03:03.330
Hey!

00:03:04.500 --> 00:03:06.500
Sorry. I have my shift coming up.

00:05:17.650 --> 00:05:21.110
Were you lonely? Sorry to have left you by yourself.

00:05:23.190 --> 00:05:24.740
"First love," huh?

00:05:25.150 --> 00:05:27.150
Senpai's pretty sharp.

00:05:48.090 --> 00:05:50.590
It's all fine. Nice and clean.

00:05:50.800 --> 00:05:52.010
Yeah?

00:05:52.260 --> 00:05:53.560
37.2 degrees Celsius.

00:05:53.560 --> 00:05:56.510
Your throat looks red as well,
so you probably have a slight cold.

00:05:56.840 --> 00:05:57.660
I see.

00:05:58.520 --> 00:06:00.650
I acted too hastily in spite of myself.

00:06:00.650 --> 00:06:04.690
It's because Shouko said that you've been
acting strangely over the past couple days.

00:06:05.440 --> 00:06:08.110
<i>I wonder if I gave her that impression because of my fever.</i>

00:06:10.240 --> 00:06:12.410
The blood test results will be back in four days.

00:06:12.830 --> 00:06:15.040
Well, I don't think there'll be any problems.

00:06:15.040 --> 00:06:16.410
Um, Doctor?

00:06:16.830 --> 00:06:17.580
Yes?

00:06:18.160 --> 00:06:20.370
Oh, no... it's nothing.

00:06:26.630 --> 00:06:29.550
You work hard at your job, Kurahashi.

00:06:29.550 --> 00:06:31.260
Oh. It's you, Mataki.

00:06:31.260 --> 00:06:35.010
What do you mean, "Oh"? I even brought you stuff to eat.

00:06:35.350 --> 00:06:36.020
Here.

00:06:36.020 --> 00:06:36.850
Thanks.

00:06:36.850 --> 00:06:38.350
Wow, how pretty!

00:06:38.350 --> 00:06:39.850
Can I use this?

00:06:40.190 --> 00:06:41.230
That one's...

00:06:42.020 --> 00:06:43.480
Nah, it's okay.

00:06:52.570 --> 00:06:55.030
This is Venetian glassware, no?

00:06:55.040 --> 00:06:55.780
Yeah.

00:06:55.790 --> 00:06:56.830
Is it expensive?

00:06:56.830 --> 00:06:57.700
Yeah.

00:07:12.010 --> 00:07:13.430
It sure rains a lot.

00:07:13.760 --> 00:07:14.470
Yeah.

00:07:15.600 --> 00:07:20.270
I heard from Hisamoto-senpai that you decided
not to go to the mixer the day before yesterday.

00:07:20.730 --> 00:07:21.640
Yeah.

00:07:21.640 --> 00:07:24.980
He was saying that you got a girlfriend.

00:07:24.980 --> 00:07:26.690
He told me that just a while ago, too.

00:07:26.690 --> 00:07:29.570
It's a habit of his to link everything to girls.

00:07:29.570 --> 00:07:32.860
True... You're not into girls, anyway.

00:08:04.980 --> 00:08:06.730
Are you sure about this, Ms. Zenshinni?

00:08:07.190 --> 00:08:09.070
Didn't this belong to your father?

00:08:09.440 --> 00:08:12.700
It hasn't been too long since he
passed away, but I have no choice

00:08:12.700 --> 00:08:14.570
if I want to pay the inheritance tax.

00:08:14.670 --> 00:08:15.210
I see...

00:08:16.160 --> 00:08:17.240
Don't worry.

00:08:17.240 --> 00:08:20.330
I'll have a trusted dealer take it
off your hands for a good price.

00:08:20.330 --> 00:08:21.330
I'm counting on you.

00:08:21.910 --> 00:08:24.500
"Everything has a soul," huh?

00:08:25.040 --> 00:08:28.540
This one sure does. His thoughts
reside in here–they're quite powerful.

00:08:31.460 --> 00:08:36.010
Ms. Zenshinni, you're a psychic,
aren't you? Do you "see" things?

00:08:36.300 --> 00:08:37.430
Well, yeah.

00:08:37.850 --> 00:08:40.850
My old man's frequently roaming around there.

00:08:41.930 --> 00:08:44.850
I wish he'd stop showing up in the shower,

00:08:44.850 --> 00:08:46.190
though I'm his daughter and all...

00:08:48.610 --> 00:08:51.820
Yuu, that girl who works over at the deli, also has a sixth sense.

00:08:52.150 --> 00:08:53.320
Oh really?

00:08:54.070 --> 00:08:55.900
What about you, Kurahashi?

00:08:56.490 --> 00:08:58.870
None at all. I'm not into that sort of thing, either.

00:08:58.870 --> 00:09:01.080
Very well. That's the right answer, too.

00:09:01.950 --> 00:09:03.500
If you develop an untoward curiosity about the spirit world

00:09:03.500 --> 00:09:06.040
or try to contact ghosts

00:09:06.040 --> 00:09:08.080
like those paranormal fanatics do,

00:09:08.710 --> 00:09:10.920
it'll be no joke.

00:09:12.010 --> 00:09:13.010
Oh...

00:09:18.430 --> 00:09:19.900
Hi, Eiri.

00:09:20.060 --> 00:09:21.720
If you'd like, have some of this.

00:09:21.720 --> 00:09:25.020
Thanks as always, Yuu. I'll take care of the rest.

00:09:25.480 --> 00:09:26.560
Thank you.

00:09:28.100 --> 00:09:29.100
I'll be going, then.

00:09:30.690 --> 00:09:31.610
What a cute girl.

00:09:31.940 --> 00:09:34.610
Oh, Michiru. Hello.

00:09:34.890 --> 00:09:35.720
Hi.

00:09:36.910 --> 00:09:38.910
Sorry, Kurahashi.

00:09:38.910 --> 00:09:40.820
I'll be borrowing your storefront again.

00:09:40.830 --> 00:09:44.240
Sure, go right ahead. If you don't
mind such a dingy store like this, that is.

00:09:49.830 --> 00:09:51.170
What a cute girl...

00:09:55.470 --> 00:09:57.340
Here are the test results.

00:09:57.340 --> 00:09:59.430
You're so normal it's not even funny.

00:09:59.430 --> 00:10:01.260
Thank you for going through all the trouble.

00:10:01.260 --> 00:10:04.140
Don't thank me. I just stopped by on my way back from lunch.

00:10:04.600 --> 00:10:06.480
Shouko, want to stop by my place?

00:10:06.480 --> 00:10:07.940
Sure, I'll come by later.

00:10:07.940 --> 00:10:10.150
3 290,000 yen...

00:10:10.520 --> 00:10:13.150
This is all thanks to the buddha's protection

00:10:13.150 --> 00:10:14.610
and your efforts Kurahashi.

00:10:14.900 --> 00:10:17.820
Thanks! I'll take you out to karaoke sometime.

00:10:19.660 --> 00:10:22.490
<i>Why does this arcade mall have so many good-looking people?</i>

00:10:22.870 --> 00:10:24.570
<i>This environment... is dangerous.</i>

00:10:26.620 --> 00:10:29.440
Don't tell me it's true that you're
actually going out with someone!

00:10:30.040 --> 00:10:31.790
Hey, who is she?

00:10:31.790 --> 00:10:34.840
Is it someone I know? Don't tell me it's Aunt Hatsumi...

00:10:34.840 --> 00:10:36.460
Well, Kurahashi?

00:10:55.940 --> 00:10:58.650
Look what you've done, Mataki! Be more careful!

00:10:59.450 --> 00:11:00.700
Kurahashi...

00:11:00.700 --> 00:11:03.410
If it had broken, there'd have been no way to fix it!

00:11:04.160 --> 00:11:06.370
lt'd just about amount to murder!

00:11:06.370 --> 00:11:07.490
What the hell?!

00:11:07.500 --> 00:11:10.960
Why do you have to act like such
a jerk... over just one freaking glass?

00:11:11.170 --> 00:11:12.250
Just?!

00:11:20.800 --> 00:11:21.630
<i>Again...</i>

00:11:22.180 --> 00:11:24.220
<i>It's happened seven days in a row now.</i>

00:11:27.310 --> 00:11:29.350
Sorry, you're right.

00:11:29.350 --> 00:11:32.560
It's merchandise... If it'd broken...

00:11:32.560 --> 00:11:34.940
I'm sorry too, for having yelled at you in spite of myself.

00:11:35.480 --> 00:11:36.980
Hey, Mataki...

00:11:37.280 --> 00:11:38.190
What?

00:11:38.190 --> 00:11:40.440
Didn't something strange happen?

00:11:41.780 --> 00:11:45.240
Never mind. Sorry for making you into a guinea pig.

00:11:45.700 --> 00:11:48.080
Kurahashi... You don't look well.

00:11:48.080 --> 00:11:50.660
There really has been something wrong with you lately.

00:11:50.660 --> 00:11:51.790
Is something wrong?

00:11:52.290 --> 00:11:55.040
Mataki, you've always been
perceptive about the strangest things.

00:11:55.210 --> 00:11:58.300
Am I acting weird? In what way?

00:11:58.300 --> 00:12:01.760
Well... You're kinda out of it...

00:12:01.760 --> 00:12:03.840
People have been telling me that a lot for a long time.

00:12:03.840 --> 00:12:08.060
That's not what I meant... It's like your mind is far away.

00:12:08.060 --> 00:12:10.680
Have I become the neighborhood loony?

00:12:11.140 --> 00:12:13.190
I don't talk to myself, do I?

00:12:13.520 --> 00:12:15.710
Is there something you suspect that might be causing it?

00:12:15.860 --> 00:12:18.360
No... nothing really.

00:12:18.900 --> 00:12:20.320
Nothing serious.

00:12:40.380 --> 00:12:42.460
Jeez, my uncle really bugs me.

00:12:42.470 --> 00:12:46.720
He gets to wander around Europe
and buy as many antiques as he likes.

00:12:46.720 --> 00:12:48.930
I wish he'd think of the people
who have to sort out his purchases.

00:12:51.560 --> 00:12:53.100
Last one.

00:12:53.100 --> 00:12:54.080
Caution

00:12:54.480 --> 00:12:59.190
An 18th-century French curio case and a set of glassware...

00:12:59.190 --> 00:13:00.770
with a retail price of 4,000,000 yen.

00:13:00.820 --> 00:13:01.800
Caution

00:13:02.030 --> 00:13:04.450
As usual, he likes to rip people off.

00:13:03.800 --> 00:13:05.250
Caution

00:13:07.240 --> 00:13:08.220
Caution

00:13:11.200 --> 00:13:12.200
Caution: Frag

00:13:14.140 --> 00:13:15.140
Caution

00:13:20.340 --> 00:13:21.710
Wow, this is beautiful.

00:14:28.610 --> 00:14:29.820
Whit's this...?

00:14:31.450 --> 00:14:32.490
Who is it?

00:14:32.490 --> 00:14:33.530
Where are you?

00:14:43.250 --> 00:14:44.460
Inside the glass?

00:14:50.340 --> 00:14:52.340
"Everything has a soul..."

00:14:53.220 --> 00:14:54.810
Is it a hallucination? A fairy?

00:14:55.520 --> 00:14:57.350
Or, a spirit within these antiques?

00:14:58.440 --> 00:15:03.730
In the glass, I can see the life of
a girl unfold like a documentary.

00:15:06.280 --> 00:15:08.030
I must be going crazy.

00:15:08.360 --> 00:15:10.740
I'm living with a delusion.

00:15:10.740 --> 00:15:12.810
A normal person would've thrown it away already,

00:15:13.120 --> 00:15:15.450
but I feel strangely drawn to it...

00:15:17.370 --> 00:15:19.830
I guess Mataki can't see this after all.

00:15:20.750 --> 00:15:22.580
Nothing shows up on my cell cam, either.

00:15:22.580 --> 00:15:24.290
It's not scary at all, either.

00:15:24.290 --> 00:15:25.750
Instead...

00:15:36.970 --> 00:15:39.640
You'll catch a cold if you sleep in a place like that.

00:15:43.360 --> 00:15:45.060
What are you?

00:15:45.070 --> 00:15:46.650
Why do you show this only to me?

00:15:51.150 --> 00:15:52.610
Today's the seventh day...

00:15:53.450 --> 00:15:55.740
The day God finished creating the heavens and the Earth.

00:15:57.990 --> 00:16:00.580
What are you going to create?

00:16:13.010 --> 00:16:15.090
Oops, it's already this late.

00:16:19.100 --> 00:16:21.560
Good night. See you again tomorrow.

00:16:31.650 --> 00:16:32.490
Don't go...

00:16:43.080 --> 00:16:44.540
What... is this?

00:17:28.040 --> 00:17:29.000
Why...

00:17:29.540 --> 00:17:31.050
Why are you going to kill me?

00:17:33.420 --> 00:17:34.840
But I love you...!

00:17:35.930 --> 00:17:37.430
I love you too,

00:17:38.010 --> 00:17:38.930
Cossette.

00:18:09.250 --> 00:18:12.500
I-I... killed...

00:18:12.500 --> 00:18:13.800
that girl?

00:18:14.760 --> 00:18:15.760
Why?

00:18:43.910 --> 00:18:45.370
Drink this...

00:18:47.000 --> 00:18:49.040
You have that right.

00:18:59.010 --> 00:19:01.470
Drink... if you do not want us to be apart...

00:19:04.390 --> 00:19:06.600
if you do not want to lose me...

00:19:37.800 --> 00:19:40.690
Delicatessen

00:19:42.010 --> 00:19:43.180
Eiri?

00:19:43.720 --> 00:19:44.800
Eiri?

00:19:46.010 --> 00:19:47.720
What happened, Eiri?!

00:19:48.560 --> 00:19:49.730
Snap out of it!

00:19:49.730 --> 00:19:51.690
Eiri?! Eiri?!

00:19:56.020 --> 00:19:57.020
Eiri...

00:20:06.950 --> 00:20:10.040
There's been a surprising number of them this past week.

00:20:10.040 --> 00:20:13.000
Maybe there are more of them than
customers who come to the arcade mall.

00:20:19.380 --> 00:20:21.840
<i>What was that all about... before today?</i>

00:20:30.060 --> 00:20:33.020
<i>Yuu said she didn't know anything about last night, either.</i>

00:20:33.020 --> 00:20:34.730
<i>I wonder if I'm weird, after all.</i>

00:20:36.310 --> 00:20:39.440
<i>I don't need to see... I'm better off not seeing it anymore.</i>

00:20:40.900 --> 00:20:42.820
Good morning, Kurahashi.

00:20:42.820 --> 00:20:44.360
I brought a customer.

00:20:45.490 --> 00:20:46.280
Hello.

00:20:47.160 --> 00:20:48.490
One of my patients.

00:20:50.620 --> 00:20:52.910
Oh, these are pretty good.

00:20:53.580 --> 00:20:57.880
You see, a lady I care about has a fancy for antiques.

00:20:58.130 --> 00:21:01.550
She insisted that she wanted to decorate
the new house I bought for her with them.

00:21:01.550 --> 00:21:04.220
And, well... she's used to getting her own way.

00:21:04.840 --> 00:21:06.010
He's talking about his mistress.

00:21:06.010 --> 00:21:09.760
He's some parvenu who made his
fortune through real estate and tax evasion.

00:21:09.760 --> 00:21:11.100
He's sketchy, isn't he?

00:21:12.270 --> 00:21:14.850
Hey, lay it on thick. How much is it?

00:21:14.850 --> 00:21:15.770
Four million yen.

00:21:16.440 --> 00:21:19.980
This one's nice. Please have it sent to my house at once.

00:21:19.980 --> 00:21:21.400
So, how much is it?

00:21:21.400 --> 00:21:25.030
Oh, well, because we'd like you to come back as a customer,

00:21:25.030 --> 00:21:28.490
we'll give you a major 30% discount today that's simply a steal,

00:21:28.490 --> 00:21:31.120
for a total of 4,598,000 yen!

00:21:34.500 --> 00:21:36.460
Kurahashi, come here a sec!

00:21:40.380 --> 00:21:44.300
When I was cleaning up, there was
a door in the back of it, and in there...

00:21:44.630 --> 00:21:47.260
<i>Why... is this girl's painting in a place like that?</i>

00:21:48.260 --> 00:21:53.850
To Cossette d'Auvergne, from Marcello Orlando with love.

00:21:54.520 --> 00:21:55.520
<i>Cossette...?</i>

00:21:55.980 --> 00:21:59.810
Marcello Orlando? I think I've
heard about him somewhere before...

00:22:01.480 --> 00:22:02.860
He's good.

00:22:02.860 --> 00:22:03.730
Yeah.

00:22:14.450 --> 00:22:17.000
They're all leaving... in one group.

00:22:19.920 --> 00:22:22.960
Some trick of the mind...
that's what I should think of it as, I guess.

00:22:24.010 --> 00:22:24.760
What?

00:22:38.060 --> 00:22:39.310
What do you think?

00:22:39.310 --> 00:22:40.770
Hm, looks good to me.

00:22:54.200 --> 00:22:56.830
Oh, Kurahashi, we're done.

00:22:58.670 --> 00:23:00.000
What's wrong?

00:23:02.840 --> 00:23:05.130
Oh my, that's pretty nice.

00:23:10.140 --> 00:23:12.510
You did better than I'd expected, Papa.

00:23:12.850 --> 00:23:13.850
Thanks.

00:23:15.640 --> 00:23:18.140
Please thank me in bed.

00:23:19.060 --> 00:23:21.440
Silly, children are watching.

00:23:23.150 --> 00:23:26.690
Thanks, I'll order some sushi, so please eat with us.

00:23:26.690 --> 00:23:27.780
No, thank you.

00:23:30.070 --> 00:23:31.660
Let's go home, Kurahashi.

00:23:34.080 --> 00:23:35.410
Let's go!

00:24:05.820 --> 00:24:07.360
<i>Don't get involved anymore.</i>

00:24:07.360 --> 00:24:08.150
<i>It's a dream.</i>

00:24:08.150 --> 00:24:09.440
<i>It's a hallucination.</i>

00:24:09.440 --> 00:24:12.820
<i>I should be going to the hospital... not there.</i>

00:24:19.080 --> 00:24:20.080
Why...?

00:24:22.420 --> 00:24:24.710
Why did you... have such sad eyes?

00:25:02.480 --> 00:25:03.850
Th-They're dead...

00:25:05.080 --> 00:25:07.500
W-Was it you who did this?

00:25:09.920 --> 00:25:13.420
Who... Who are you? Who are you?!

00:25:14.050 --> 00:25:15.880
Why is it that only I can see you,

00:25:15.890 --> 00:25:17.890
and why do you have such sad eyes?!

00:26:23.160 --> 00:26:27.960
<i>This is a grudge... a curse... I'll be killed!</i>

00:26:36.970 --> 00:26:38.300
Stop!

00:26:39.090 --> 00:26:42.350
Please stop!!!

00:29:14.210 --> 00:29:18.840
<i>For 250 years... I have been searching aimlessly...</i>

00:29:18.840 --> 00:29:20.800
<i>for someone who could see me.</i>

00:29:21.840 --> 00:29:24.470
<i>For someone who would make the contract of blood with me.</i>

00:29:25.720 --> 00:29:29.220
<i>For someone who would bring
deliverance to the souls of the cursed antiques.</i>

00:29:36.060 --> 00:29:39.440
<i>That man's soul is full of malice...</i>

00:29:40.530 --> 00:29:44.610
<i>Even as their swordlike curse pierced his soul,</i>

00:29:44.610 --> 00:29:49.160
<i>it devoured the curse...
engulfed the curse... and became a demon.</i>

00:29:54.620 --> 00:29:57.290
<i>An irreparably stained, wretched demon.</i>

00:29:59.250 --> 00:30:01.130
<i>Don't toy with me...</i>

00:30:01.130 --> 00:30:04.420
<i>Don't torture my hert... What sin am I guilty of?</i>

00:30:06.970 --> 00:30:10.720
<i>Is it wrong... to have feelings for an illusion?</i>

00:30:10.720 --> 00:30:12.720
<i>To fall in love with something that is not human?</i>

00:30:13.520 --> 00:30:15.480
<i>And it ends with this?!</i>

00:30:24.030 --> 00:30:25.860
<i>You will not even be allowed to run away</i>

00:30:26.360 --> 00:30:29.700
<i>if you have feelings for me... for my sake.</i>

00:30:44.260 --> 00:30:47.130
No... I don't want to be apart from you.

00:30:47.130 --> 00:30:49.260
I don't... want to lose you.

00:31:14.040 --> 00:31:15.740
<i>You must not run,</i>

00:31:16.160 --> 00:31:17.710
<i>no matter how painful it is.</i>

00:31:44.980 --> 00:31:47.280
<i>I was killed by that man.</i>

00:31:48.030 --> 00:31:51.450
<i>The antiques' souls bore a fierce hatred for that man,</i>

00:31:51.450 --> 00:31:56.490
<i>and due to their very fierceness, they have
brought misfortune upon innocent people, even now.</i>

00:31:56.490 --> 00:31:57.620
<i>It was hard for me...</i>

00:31:57.620 --> 00:32:01.290
<i>It is an intolerable pain to me... to have killed you...</i>

00:32:01.290 --> 00:32:03.960
<i>And when the man is reborn,</i>

00:32:03.960 --> 00:32:08.300
<i>they appear and attempt to possess the man to kill him.</i>

00:32:08.300 --> 00:32:12.450
<i>because... I love you, more than anyone else...</i>

00:32:30.150 --> 00:32:31.650
<i>It's all right now.</i>

00:32:31.650 --> 00:32:33.740
<i>You don't have to cry for me.</i>

00:32:39.700 --> 00:32:41.710
<i>Good night...</i>

00:32:41.710 --> 00:32:42.710
<i>for eternity.</i>

00:33:13.360 --> 00:33:17.200
<i>In order to save the cursed antiques' souls,</i>

00:33:17.200 --> 00:33:20.950
<i>I had to bring that wretched man back to life.</i>

00:33:23.040 --> 00:33:26.170
<i>You have a duty to atone for your sins.</i>

00:33:27.000 --> 00:33:30.090
<i>You who loved me, drank my blood,</i>

00:33:30.090 --> 00:33:34.010
<i>and inherited the killer's soul and fate.</i>

00:33:45.060 --> 00:33:47.810
Eiri, help me.

00:34:04.710 --> 00:34:05.710
Cossette...

00:34:11.300 --> 00:34:12.300
Okay.

00:34:14.010 --> 00:34:15.050
Thank you.

00:34:39.870 --> 00:34:44.240
Listening quietly to the singing

00:34:44.330 --> 00:34:50.250
that secretly flows down my way,

00:34:51.130 --> 00:34:55.510
we share the white sigh of the moon

00:34:55.590 --> 00:35:01.390
with a sweet kiss

00:35:02.460 --> 00:35:07.420
as though we're lovers.

00:35:07.940 --> 00:35:10.810
Hold me closer.

00:35:10.900 --> 00:35:14.650
I feel as though my love is supported

00:35:14.820 --> 00:35:20.970
by the depth of the wounds I must atone for.

00:35:21.260 --> 00:35:25.910
So for now, I want to thaw your frozen heart

00:35:26.000 --> 00:35:32.840
with pain, rather than kindness.

00:35:33.340 --> 00:35:37.210
I will always be close to you

00:35:37.300 --> 00:35:43.350
like a shadow you cannot elude.

00:35:43.680 --> 00:35:48.350
The teardrops you let fall

00:35:48.890 --> 00:35:56.610
adorn my fingers like jewels, shining brightly.

00:36:21.210 --> 00:36:24.810
We will surely go together

00:36:25.020 --> 00:36:31.230
beyond these meadows that glisten so brilliantly.

00:36:31.500 --> 00:36:36.150
So for now, I will cling to the strength of our entwined fingers,

00:36:36.480 --> 00:36:43.030
and not let go of your solitude

00:36:43.620 --> 00:36:47.410
because we will be able to find

00:36:47.620 --> 00:36:53.620
the flicker of light, even deep in the darkness.

00:36:53.870 --> 00:36:58.730
Searching for the distant jeweled slumber,

00:36:59.020 --> 00:37:07.140
I have faith in the strength to go beyond the night.
